        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: பொறுப்பு",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "பொறுப்பு — poṟuppu — \"responsibility\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "குழந்தைகளைப் பார்த்துக்கொள்வது பெற்றோரின் பொறுப்பு. kuḻantaikaḷaip pārttukkoḷvatu peṟṟōriṉ poṟuppu. Looking after children is the parents' responsibility."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "பொறுப்பாக, responsibly. பொறுப்பேற்றுக்கொள், to take responsibility."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "பொறுப்பு (poṟuppu) is native Dravidian: DEDR 4565 lists Tamil poṟu, \"to bear, sustain, endure, take responsibility\", and poṟuppu, \"a burden borne\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for giving reasons and opinions."
